  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DAIRY PLANT PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT AIMS AT THE CONSTRUCTION OF A DAIRY PLANT FOR PROCESSING RAW MILK INTO PASTEURIZED MILK, YOUGHART AND CHEESE WITH A DAILY PROCESSING CAPACITY OF 15,000 LITERS TO SUPPLY THE MARKET WITH 8 TONNES OF PATEURIZED MILK, 4 TONNES OF YOUGHURT, 250 KG OF LABNEH ( A THICK CREAMY YOUGHART) AND 300 KG OF WHITE SOFT CHEESE.</narrative>
  </description>
